<!doctype lake><title>🐳 𝓓𝓮𝓮𝓹𝓢𝓮𝓮𝓴</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="A5X3u" id="A5X3u" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4eeeed13" id="u4eeeed13">🐋</span><span data-lake-id="u4ea8621c" id="u4ea8621c"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐕𝟑 𝐓𝐞𝐜𝐡𝐧𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐥 𝐑𝐞𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u482dd28d" id="u482dd28d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubbba7f98" id="ubbba7f98">进一步拓展开源模型的能力边界，作者扩大模型规模，推出 DeepSeek-V3。一个总参数量为 671B 的大型 MOE 模型，每个 token 激活其中的 37B 参数</span></strong></p><ul list="u7708cd58"><li fid="u93d7ceca" data-lake-id="uc92f0ed7" id="uc92f0ed7"><span data-lake-id="ue5772327" id="ue5772327">在架构方面，DeepSeek-V3 仍采用多头潜在注意力实现高效推理，并采用 DeepSeekMoE 实现高性价比训练</span></li><li fid="u93d7ceca" data-lake-id="u157dcd7b" id="u157dcd7b"><span data-lake-id="u73223586" id="u73223586">在基础架构之外，作者还采用两项策略，以进一步增强模型能力。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d51f745" id="u5d51f745" style="color: #5C0036">首先，DeepSeek-V3 率先采用无辅助损失的负载均衡策略，旨在尽量减小促进负载均衡对模型性能造成的不利影响。其次，DeepSeek-V3 采用多 token 预测训练目标，作者观察到，该目标能够提升模型在评测基准上的整体表现</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8e94f07f" id="u8e94f07f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6b38dd8" id="uf6b38dd8">作者支持 FP8 混合精度训练，并对训练框架进行全面优化。低精度训练已成为一种颇具前景的高效训练方案，其发展与硬件能力的进步密切相关</span></strong></p><ul list="ud3c44717"><li fid="u475cfe04" data-lake-id="u5c618248" id="u5c618248"><span data-lake-id="u25cbf804" id="u25cbf804">提出 FP8 混合精度训练框架，并首次在超大规模模型上验证其有效性。通过支持 FP8 计算与存储，实现训练加速和 GPU 显存占用的降低</span></li><li fid="u475cfe04" data-lake-id="u76e458ba" id="u76e458ba"><span data-lake-id="u5c92381e" id="u5c92381e">设计用于高效流水线并行的 DualPipe 算法。该算法的流水线气泡更少，并通过计算与通信重叠，隐藏训练过程中的大部分通信开销。这种重叠使得在模型规模进一步扩大时，只要保持计算与通信的比例不变，就仍然能够跨节点使用细粒度专家，同时实现接近于零的 all-to-all 通信开销</span></li><li fid="u475cfe04" data-lake-id="ub86e32b1" id="ub86e32b1"><span data-lake-id="u0f2acdb8" id="u0f2acdb8">开发高效的跨节点 all-to-all 通信内核，以充分利用 InfiniBand（IB）和 NVLink 的带宽。作者还对内存占用进行细致优化，使得在不使用开销较大的张量并行的情况下训练 DeepSeek-V3 成为可能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uab1d4830" id="uab1d4830"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f16e17d" id="u0f16e17d">在预训练阶段，作者使用 14.8T 个高质量且多样化的 token 训练 DeepSeek-V3。预训练过程十分稳定。在整个训练过程中，没有出现任何不可恢复的损失突增，也无须回滚</span></strong></p><ul list="u4b61b4e5"><li fid="uddde3247" data-lake-id="ue62263ab" id="ue62263ab"><span data-lake-id="uc06d4524" id="uc06d4524">随后，作者对 DeepSeek-V3 进行两个阶段的上下文长度扩展。第一阶段将最大上下文长度扩展至 32K，第二阶段进一步扩展至 128K</span></li><li fid="uddde3247" data-lake-id="u3c0fa860" id="u3c0fa860"><span data-lake-id="ua48d21b4" id="ua48d21b4">此后，作者对 DeepSeek-V3 基座模型进行后训练，包括监督微调和强化学习，使其与人类偏好对齐，并进一步释放其潜力</span></li><li fid="uddde3247" data-lake-id="uc6054292" id="uc6054292"><span data-lake-id="u3a2a89ce" id="u3a2a89ce">在后训练阶段，作者从 DeepSeek-R1 系列模型中蒸馏推理能力，同时谨慎维持模型准确性与生成长度之间的平衡</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0844fe67" id="u0844fe67"><strong><span data-lake-id="u89199603" id="u89199603" style="color: #664900">创新的负载均衡策略与训练目标：在 DeepSeek-V2 高效架构的基础上，作者率先提出无辅助损失的负载均衡策略，最大限度地降低促进负载均衡所带来的性能退化。作者研究多 token 预测目标，并证明其有助于提升模型性能。该方法还可用于投机解码，以加速推理</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u31283c5a" id="u31283c5a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u44283fd6" id="u44283fd6" style="color: #E4495B">作者设计 FP8 混合精度训练框架，并首次在超大规模模型上验证 FP8 训练的可行性与有效性</span></strong></p><ul list="u5838e37b"><li fid="u601315b8" data-lake-id="u9f73b338" id="u9f73b338"><span data-lake-id="ud19302ae" id="ud19302ae">通过算法、框架和硬件的协同设计，作者克服跨节点 MoE 训练中的通信瓶颈，实现计算与通信近乎完全的重叠。这显著提高训练效率并降低训练成本，使得无需额外开销即可进一步扩大模型规模</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u47235e98" id="u47235e98"><strong><span data-lake-id="u17407573" id="u17407573" style="color: #E4495B">从 DeepSeek-R1 进行知识蒸馏。作者提出一种创新方法，将长思维链模型的推理能力蒸馏至标准 LLM</span></strong></p><ul list="ub28f2ce3"><li fid="u83cd030d" data-lake-id="ue3abc5f7" id="ue3abc5f7"><span data-lake-id="ufda2d2f7" id="ufda2d2f7">具体而言，是从 DeepSeek-R1 系列中的一个模型向 DeepSeek-V3 蒸馏推理能力。该流程将 R1 的验证与反思模式巧妙地融入 DeepSeek-V3，显著提升其推理性能。同时，作者也保持对 DeepSeek-V3 输出风格和长度的控制</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="rRMqt" id="rRMqt" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u75a43e54" id="u75a43e54">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="uc8e0cfcf" id="uc8e0cfcf"> 𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐢𝐜 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u3f78269d" id="u3f78269d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u38375309" id="u38375309">DeepSeek-V3 的基本架构仍基于 Transformer 框架。为实现高效推理与低成本训练，DeepSeek-V3 同样采用已在 DeepSeek-V2 中得到充分验证的 MLA 和 DeepSeekMoE。与 DeepSeek-V2 不同的是，作者额外为 DeepSeekMoE 引入无辅助损失的负载均衡策略，以减轻为确保负载均衡而导致的性能退化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4e81c26b" id="u4e81c26b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u09c4a19f" id="u09c4a19f" style="color: #663000">在注意力方面，DeepSeek-V3 采用 MLA 架构。设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A6d1o%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaed9ee21" id="uaed9ee21" style="color: #663000">表示嵌入维度，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c3e4ad6127db0eaa2934769e2098781.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22My6bP%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1c163f7" id="ud1c163f7" style="color: #663000">表示注意力头数，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a51260b8293a322049a4a40cc888982.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XLFZ0%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3178ecec" id="u3178ecec" style="color: #663000">表示每个头的维度，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37e5c66ec276f364aaff2c7b1c0470d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kho2x%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u00a316cd" id="u00a316cd" style="color: #663000">表示第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cBsqi%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u93a89608" id="u93a89608" style="color: #663000">个 token 在某个注意力层中的注意力输入。MLA 的核心是对注意力的键和值进行联合低秩压缩，以减少推理过程中的键值缓存</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u004c7b0b" id="u004c7b0b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%7D%7D%20%3D%20W%5E%7BDKV%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5899723ae20a11120276b2aa3d58bf1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ld3V2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uadfaab0c" id="uadfaab0c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5E%7BC%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7BC%7D%20%3D%20W%5E%7BUK%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92cca3c24f8c5cad7ee8d9673dea748f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LZjMe%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua3d0b816" id="ua3d0b816" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7BR%7D%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoPE%7D%5C%5Cleft(W%5E%7BKR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95c99cfefc55260ab9c844310b9e651b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c70xF%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6840a9dd" id="u6840a9dd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7BR%7D%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Facf45f94209589403e4fa2757a304266.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MIlZM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf888db2b" id="uf888db2b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5E%7BC%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5E%7BC%7D%20%3D%20W%5E%7BUV%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17d12489a61e51181165160733818ec4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UFrvc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u94811a9f"><li fid="u2f0af566" data-lake-id="ufd67b4b4" id="ufd67b4b4"><span data-lake-id="u242ef1ba" id="u242ef1ba">对于注意力查询，作者同样进行低秩压缩，以减少训练过程中的激活内存占用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u209ae75b" id="u209ae75b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%20%3D%20W%5E%7BDQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F388b57cc62f1f3f8a1ce25c5d887fef1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Whfoj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua01ab641" id="ua01ab641" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5E%7BC%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5E%7BC%7D%20%3D%20W%5E%7BUQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc2ec113ac2e75ffeb4622135757ca74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wliVs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf9da863f" id="uf9da863f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%5E%7BR%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%5E%7BR%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5E%7BR%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5E%7BR%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoPE%7D%5C%5Cleft(W%5E%7BQR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84c57566317ba6f8cce1c55e40debe45.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AZjXB%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udbf545b4" id="udbf545b4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5E%7BC%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5E%7BR%7D%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3211d720dbf91468ebaadc7760d33d7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PhF6G%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud87f25fa"><li fid="uce0d6b6e" data-lake-id="u0f8eccca" id="u0f8eccca"><span data-lake-id="u83a18c9e" id="u83a18c9e">最终，将注意力查询</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe98ba48194d45c4ee7dbf1b271f36e02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dn4Vw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24525cec" id="u24525cec">、键</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2f789e5584ef51f0788669183306e39.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jn4H0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1a686c5" id="ue1a686c5">和值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%5E%7BC%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba77d2b0f5d8a126f9dbdde8724edc48.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OD7JT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c459b9f" id="u6c459b9f">结合，得到最终的注意力输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e4aed712f34784d39d10eca50b423ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Urc6b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua067e7f4" id="ua067e7f4">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7b66e214" id="u7b66e214" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd_h%20%2B%20d_h%5ER%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%5E%7BC%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c91b7c81367d8e8235478153878dd66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RyGsk%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4f5dfbff" id="u4f5dfbff" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%20%3D%20W%5EO%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fedcb09441462796efc417e109e71f88f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U1iL0%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub77d1448" id="ub77d1448"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb1e7434" id="ueb1e7434">DeepSeekMoE 的基本架构。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua155f9b6" id="ua155f9b6">对于前馈网络，DeepSeek-V3 采用 DeepSeekMoE 架构。与 GShard 等传统 MoE 架构相比，DeepSeekMoE 使用细粒度专家，并隔离出部分专家作为共享专家。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e4aed712f34784d39d10eca50b423ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ks9VI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u479727da" id="u479727da">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vGtiD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5255183" id="uc5255183">个 token 的 FFN 输入，则 FFN 输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b7a574ac3c42b6fd1f4250ff9cfe553.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zYXcB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubee226a7" id="ubee226a7">的计算如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="u640e7195" id="u640e7195" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_s%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7B(s)%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_r%7D%20g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7B(r)%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c99e7e438396a68d207095761ab191e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kDHXk%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u46306b92" id="u46306b92" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg_%7Bi%2Ct%7D'%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_r%7D%20g_%7Bj%2Ct%7D'%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc803b489c7ae2113cc9d6a4a4cc96341.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IaTXe%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1db954ce" id="u1db954ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20N_r%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20K_r%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a9127399e50e0309f893902f28bd9e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q5Cag%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7ec04437" id="u7ec04437" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSigmoid%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5ET%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_i%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf97911ba720bfe8eedc1f5ab2a52235.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TcXwX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u37915c6d"><li fid="ue072942f" data-lake-id="u2cf43943" id="u2cf43943"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34c041f7" id="u34c041f7" style="color: #AD1A2B">与 DeepSeek-V2 略有不同，DeepSeek-V3 使用 sigmoid 函数计算亲和度得分，并对所有被选中的亲和度得分进行归一化，以得到门控值</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udb187f4d" id="udb187f4d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua65930a1" id="ua65930a1" style="color: #004347">无辅助损失的负载均衡。对于 MoE 模型，专家负载不均衡会导致路由坍塌，并降低采用专家并行时的计算效率。传统解决方案通常依赖辅助损失来避免负载不均衡。然而，过大的辅助损失会损害模型性能</span></strong></p><ul list="u6bd46131"><li fid="u03760e77" data-lake-id="ua7a07cb5" id="ua7a07cb5"><span data-lake-id="u60c2869b" id="u60c2869b">为更好地权衡负载均衡与模型性能，作者率先提出无辅助损失的负载均衡策略，以确保负载均衡。具体而言，为每个专家引入一个偏置项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a1e6a280559d96bdb68224b12ce4487.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g2FUI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c0290a5" id="u6c0290a5">，并将其加到相应的亲和度得分</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jVASg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub451ffb0" id="ub451ffb0">上，以决定 top-K 路由</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u92d07d3c" id="u92d07d3c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%2B%20b_i%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%2B%20b_j%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20N_r%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20K_r%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D.%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F854701d655e0baa6ed40d216bc75dffd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JFPkl%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uda5e937b"><li fid="u3727e661" data-lake-id="u08fc286b" id="u08fc286b"><span data-lake-id="u024540bc" id="u024540bc">偏置项仅用于路由。与 FFN 输出相乘的门控值仍由原始亲和度得分</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sXk8t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad793f3d" id="uad793f3d">得到</span></li><li fid="u3727e661" data-lake-id="u4dd790d0" id="u4dd790d0"><span data-lake-id="u53d5b037" id="u53d5b037">在训练过程中，作者持续监测每个训练步骤中整个批次上的专家负载。在每个步骤结束时，如果相应专家过载，则将其偏置减小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kivGm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u356ac7cb" id="u356ac7cb">；如果相应专家负载不足，则将其偏置增大</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AVoFM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40f20d9f" id="u40f20d9f">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ID8ox%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6974018c" id="u6974018c">是称为偏置更新速率的超参数</span></li><li fid="u3727e661" data-lake-id="ub3958a48" id="ub3958a48"><span data-lake-id="u87d2ed10" id="u87d2ed10">通过这种动态调整，DeepSeek-V3 在训练过程中保持专家负载均衡，并取得优于仅通过辅助损失促进负载均衡的模型的性能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf21f666e" id="uf21f666e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u552ec398" id="u552ec398">补充性的序列级辅助损失。尽管 DeepSeek-V3 主要依赖无辅助损失策略实现负载均衡，但为防止任意单条序列内出现极端不均衡，作者还采用补充性的序列级均衡损失</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uedf8ddb6" id="uedf8ddb6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_r%7D%20f_i%20P_i%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22e62aa1b1d0d02b5f583d289296c5bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YMQ8M%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1178b4c9" id="u1178b4c9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BN_r%7D%7BK_r%20T%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20N_r%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20K_r%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca00e905b8866b6c2ed44048462cfafc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fmQtw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7c09e4d8" id="u7c09e4d8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bs_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_r%7D%20s_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f7f8abad202596831f2f1162be7e223.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VezJs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub6ca80ea" id="ub6ca80ea" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D'%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde81627d02a609bdc25ee00e5f2bc7c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rMiSX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4c511dc9" id="u4c511dc9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u80a64efa" id="u80a64efa">节点受限路由。与 DeepSeek-V2 使用的设备受限路由类似，DeepSeek-V3 同样使用受限路由机制，以限制训练过程中的通信成本</span></strong></p><ul list="u853816ce"><li fid="uf9cb898f" data-lake-id="u0afe69cb" id="u0afe69cb"><span data-lake-id="u322cd287" id="u322cd287">作者确保每个 token 最多被发送至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FAqrj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc75b962" id="ufc75b962">个节点。这些节点根据各节点上亲和度得分最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7BK_r%7D%7BM%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b169d2a35e0c23c006f206281288475.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YpDfn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35f43c25" id="u35f43c25">个专家的得分之和进行选择。在这一约束下，作者的 MoE 训练框架能够近乎实现计算与通信的完全重叠</span></li><li fid="uf9cb898f" data-lake-id="u52354222" id="u52354222"><span data-lake-id="ufc6885e4" id="ufc6885e4">得益于有效的负载均衡策略，DeepSeek-V3 在整个训练过程中保持良好的负载均衡。因此，DeepSeek-V3 在训练过程中不丢弃任何 token</span></li><li fid="uf9cb898f" data-lake-id="ud74fae1a" id="ud74fae1a"><span data-lake-id="u063520ff" id="u063520ff">此外，作者还采用特定的部署策略来确保推理负载均衡，因此 DeepSeek-V3 在推理过程中也不丢弃 token</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="l3om0" id="l3om0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uee23331e" id="uee23331e">🌴 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢-𝐓𝐨𝐤𝐞𝐧 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐝𝐢𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5fa76200" id="u5fa76200"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b7fe0b9" id="u2b7fe0b9" style="color: #663000">受 Gloeckle et al.（2024）的启发，作者为 DeepSeek-V3 研究并设置多 token 预测目标，将每个位置的预测范围扩展至多个未来 token</span></strong></p><ul list="ufd39b897"><li fid="u979e9d2b" data-lake-id="u86a6c02a" id="u86a6c02a"><span data-lake-id="uc637961b" id="uc637961b">一方面，MTP 目标使训练信号更加密集，并可能提高数据利用效率。另一方面，MTP 可能使模型能够提前规划其表示，以更好地预测未来 token</span></li><li fid="u979e9d2b" data-lake-id="u5c5ed2af" id="u5c5ed2af"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e4d9c6f" id="u2e4d9c6f" style="color: #5C0036">Gloeckle et al.（2024）使用独立的输出头并行预测</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FS1U6%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u10da69c1" id="u10da69c1" style="color: #5C0036">个额外 token；与之不同，作者按顺序预测额外 token，并在每个预测深度保留完整的因果链</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u931b13ce" id="u931b13ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790611964172-56a9b6d3-1e21-475e-92c0-1347ce6756ba.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucf8f2d33-15b7-4ae7-8ddc-942d43bde82%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u78bde818-a1fd-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A852.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A389%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A99257%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1169%2C%22originHeight%22%3A534%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A886%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A530%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMERBLOCKXL%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(NEXTTOKENPREDLICTIOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A431%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSS-ENTROPYLOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A531%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(NEXTTOKENPREDICTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A174%2C%22y%22%3A431%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(NEXTSTOKENPREDICTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A141%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEARPROJECTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A526%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEARPROJECTIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A881%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CROSS-ENTROPYLOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A170%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A964%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MTPMODULE2%22%2C%22x%22%3A787%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROSS-ENTROPYLOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A888%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A861%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MTPMODULE1%22%2C%22x%22%3A434%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A529%2C%22y%22%3A431%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A885%2C%22y%22%3A430%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A166%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A892%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATLO%22%2C%22x%22%3A925%2C%22y%22%3A354%2C%22wid