0"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4a01710" id="uc4a01710" style="color: #000000">个额外 token</span></strong></p><ul list="u7824c46b"><li fid="ud252f93d" data-lake-id="ue3a60a31" id="ue3a60a31"><span data-lake-id="uf769cc9a" id="uf769cc9a">第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Py25A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf4ea3bb" id="ucf4ea3bb">个 MTP 模块由一个共享嵌入层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BEmb%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6c320ca849e52c61f5ff4ed22149418.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d6mvu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39df2dc1" id="u39df2dc1">、一个共享输出头 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BOutHead%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13bf8d1e302f42f399997bf8f4d94aa3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oSpHt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf93f04bd" id="uf93f04bd">、一个 Transformer 块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTRM%7D_k(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F42e40263c8a9eee0928ef4234afa7881.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gfE2u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b05f54d" id="u5b05f54d">和一个投影矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_k%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%20%5C%5Ctimes%202d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdcd5d966e932cb5a616d5e1c8ea2a00e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sx7hv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3d485b1" id="ua3d485b1">组成。对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sf1fG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15861f58" id="u15861f58">个输入 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l05kM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaded21e3" id="uaded21e3">，在第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sc7TB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f154b08" id="u3f154b08">个预测深度，首先通过线性投影，将第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lbFGt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueddd13fb" id="ueddd13fb">个 token 在第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(k-1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29e6a009b10e6a2a9d143bc474daa7f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qq7e5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f36cfde" id="u5f36cfde">个深度的表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5E%7Bk-1%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00dca98dc3e52d4dab5595f3a559dc03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dGN2j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u408b3b2a" id="u408b3b2a">与第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(i%2Bk)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f67494ed23f98f11af0f6114093d4c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bp0Mx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d5b6e21" id="u0d5b6e21">个 token 的嵌入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BEmb%7D(t_%7Bi%2Bk%7D)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08144c2f8e7d66258263a58a3bd3e3ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LDSfb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1359652d" id="u1359652d">结合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7a2eb0b8" id="u7a2eb0b8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%20k%7D%20%3D%20M_k%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5E%7Bk-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%3B%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BEmb%7D(t_%7Bi%2Bk%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1702f259ebc10d4f83eaa1840861703.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iFWHK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7d9c5928"><li fid="u5e9d9fda" data-lake-id="u1fc5d691" id="u1fc5d691"><span data-lake-id="u19b11f0a" id="u19b11f0a">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79b3b3ebbefa177bcb4a0457e76f46e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NxD0T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u646f188e" id="u646f188e">表示拼接。特别地，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29451a8fe9e2c369b77e30ea1655ac46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njzYp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6a05a2e6" id="u6a05a2e6">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5E%7Bk-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fafec5b0a637e64ca14ec88c26fb96be6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z4wfw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u173a898b" id="u173a898b">指主模型给出的表示。需要注意的是，每个 MTP 模块的嵌入层均与主模型共享。组合后的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%20k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a57137625e20fa768fa8d0f10610070.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aeNbd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ae40ff2" id="u9ae40ff2"> 作为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R4TAf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce3296db" id="uce3296db">个深度的 Transformer 块的输入，生成当前深度的输出表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F743f3fc053f2664e25566ae42c196d56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B7Eiv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05d803fb" id="u05d803fb">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u77d4fc73" id="u77d4fc73" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7B1%3AT-k%7D%5E%7Bk%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTRM%7D_k%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7B1%3AT-k%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%20k%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d3b779181a69ebe60cc018a41348c0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZFKX5%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uebc9cbc3"><li fid="ud5626eae" data-lake-id="u83b9c012" id="u83b9c012"><span data-lake-id="ud3a8ab8e" id="ud3a8ab8e">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R1zHS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7db9b1ce" id="u7db9b1ce">表示输入序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%3Aj%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13ee48b225d72430f28d6e4f962eeb03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TU8Ys%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0364da8e" id="u0364da8e">表示切片操作，包含左右两端的边界。最后，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F743f3fc053f2664e25566ae42c196d56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Trcef%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96b26677" id="u96b26677">为输入，共享输出头计算第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z9bYL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f216c09" id="u5f216c09">个额外预测 token 的概率分布 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bi%2Bk%2B1%7D%5E%7Bk%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F50c61f4b39e3ba20f2f91e72518de46c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fWjle%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f16a3a3" id="u6f16a3a3">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SqEi3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc152efe8" id="uc152efe8">为词表大小</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u23278568" id="u23278568" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bi%2Bk%2B1%7D%5E%7Bk%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BOutHead%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_i%5Ek%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F536e5c0b92901bcd507fedc47e8ce118.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R5X9h%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3e6bc4ef"><li fid="ufd1941c8" data-lake-id="u7e814b9e" id="u7e814b9e"><span data-lake-id="u725a7d34" id="u725a7d34">输出头</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BOutHead%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13bf8d1e302f42f399997bf8f4d94aa3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R5p53%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube15b06f" id="ube15b06f">将表示线性映射为 logits，随后应用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2bd4f783037f710ff14679a9a43c5e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gyrgB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucda963bf" id="ucda963bf">函数，计算第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XwMAx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u170c7e49" id="u170c7e49">个额外 token 的预测概率。此外，每个 MTP 模块的输出头均与主模型共享。作者保留预测因果链的原则与 EAGLE 类似，但 EAGLE 的主要目标是投机解码，而作者使用 MTP 来改进训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8d07c5aa" id="u8d07c5aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u75198487" id="u75198487" style="color: #663000">MTP 训练目标。对于每个预测深度，计算一个交叉熵损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMTP%7D%7D%5Ek%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b8c1d4032c90635398bb320c1b216be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pnDOd%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u47786157" id="u47786157" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMTP%7D%7D%5Ek%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCrossEntropy%7D%5C%5Cleft(P_%7B2%2Bk%3AT%2B1%7D%5E%7Bk%7D%2C%20t_%7B2%2Bk%3AT%2B1%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D2%2Bk%7D%5E%7BT%2B1%7D%5C%5Clog%20P_i%5Ek%5Bt_i%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F230624a845faea5261a714f2f2d99a6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JNww1%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufb352db7"><li fid="u6e24cc3e" data-lake-id="ub2d8dd14" id="ub2d8dd14"><span data-lake-id="ud66ff49c" id="ud66ff49c">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vqvrW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcfaaa28" id="ufcfaaa28">表示输入序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jc38d%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f44cfa0" id="u7f44cfa0">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CwuTX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d288768" id="u4d288768">个位置的真实 token，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i%5Ek%5Bt_i%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43c0e56a2079b384ad40c4eec272eb27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EaiTc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaec70589" id="uaec70589">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P44u5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f3b5c83" id="u0f3b5c83">个 MTP 模块给出的、与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ExYVc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5666108b" id="u5666108b">对应的预测概率。最后，对所有深度的 MTP 损失取平均，并乘以权重因子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y34wD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae30574f" id="uae30574f">，得到总体 MTP 损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMTP%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21915aba80c50bb80b6e063c07d97621.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ie24e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46d673ac" id="u46d673ac">，作为 DeepSeek-V3 的额外训练目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5780033f" id="u5780033f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMTP%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Clambda%7D%7BD%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7BD%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMTP%7D%7D%5Ek.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B25%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d24c7557ff5584d3f4e658397a96a45.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mr81C%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u05a917eb" id="u05a917eb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c89222c" id="u0c89222c">推理中的 MTP。 作者的 MTP 策略主要旨在提升主模型的性能，因此在推理过程中，可以直接移除 MTP 模块，主模型仍能独立、正常地运行。此外，还可以将这些 MTP 模块用于投机解码，以进一步降低生成延迟</span></strong></p>